  "description": "Teamfight Manager 2 v0.5.1 compatibility build. It restores the League-style Ban/Pick chrome and illustration assets on top of exact native 0.5.1 layouts while preserving the new turn outline, wait overlay, and skill-name nodes. All stale 0.5.0 client/server extension vtables, including dynamic render-command rewrites, remain disabled by default to prevent the third-Ban Option::unwrap crash. Yone's E ledger no longer calls the legacy opaque GameCtx service registry during level-1 attacks, and Shen's transparent Q endpoint now has a complete projectile-view binding so base 0.5.1 cannot unwrap a missing runtime asset. Stable combat-native Mod API 0.8 hooks remain enabled.",
  "last_updated": "2026-07-15",
